\&\- ENGINE cryptographic module support
.SH SYNOPSIS
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
.Vb 1
\& #include <openssl/engine.h>
.Ve
.PP
The following functions have been removed in OpenSSL 4.0. Provider API should be
used instead.
.PP
